<title>USA: Equitable Resources CEO to retire early.</title>
<headline>Equitable Resources CEO to retire early.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equitable Resources Inc said on Thursday president and chief executive Frederick Abrew, 59, would retire early, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Donald Moritz, chairman of the board's executive committee, would become Equitable's interim CEO, it said. Moritz had been chairman and CEO until his retirement in 1994.</p>
<p>Abrew, who joined Equitable in 1980, had held the position of president and CEO since January 1995.</p>
<p>Equitable Resources is an energy exploration, distribution and marketing company.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
